 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The simplest member of the class of ifosfamides that is 1,3,2-oxazaphosphinan-2-amine 2-oxide substituted by 2-chloroethyl groups on both the nitrogen atoms respectively. It is a nitrogen mustard alkylating agent used in the treatment of advanced breast cancer.</bp:comment>
